flowchart LR
    A[16-kHz waveform] --> B[Silence trimming]
    B --> C[Frozen WavLM Base-Plus]
    C --> D[Layers 4, 8, 12\n8 segment mean + std tokens]
    D --> E[Dual-scale temporal adapter\ndepthwise conv + Transformer + attention pooling]

    E --> F[Emotion classifier]
    E --> G[Global emotion prototypes]
    G --> H[Bounded corpus residual prototypes]
    E --> I[Progressive corpus adversarial head]
    E --> J[Progressive speaker adversarial head]

    F --> K[Adaptive classifier-prototype fusion]
    G --> K
    H --> K

    D -. same-label / different-corpus .-> L[Cross-corpus feature mixup]
    L --> K
    D -. different-label / different-corpus .-> M[Boundary-entropy pseudo-OOD]
    M --> K

    K --> N[Temperature scaling]
    N --> O[Classwise conformal prediction set]
    K --> P[Hybrid shift / unknown score\nconfidence + entropy + prototype distance + dispersion]
    O --> Q[Auto-accept / prediction set / human review]
    P --> Q
